":"merge: resolve conflicts and port all main features to microfrontends\n\n- Resolve 19 ''deleted by them'' conflicts (keep all MF architecture files)\n- Restore deleted MF infrastructure (apps/*, packages/shared/*, docker/*, scripts/*, docs/*)\n\nFeatures ported from main (pixel-perfect):\n- New Plataforma page (replaces Explore) in apps/dashboard\n- New CalendarDialog component in apps/shell\n- Task entity: add startDate field (packages/shared)\n- taskStore: auto-set startDate/dueDate on status change (packages/shared)\n- pomodoroStore: refactor to timestamp-based timing (packages/shared)\n- ThemeProviderWrapper: reduced heading font sizes (packages/shared)\n- TaskCard: onEdit prop, status chip, Edit menu item (apps/tasks)\n- TaskDialog: edit mode with startDate/dueDate fields (apps/tasks)\n- PomodoroTimer: improved tick logic (apps/tasks)\n- Tarefas: editingTask state, orderedTasks for list view (apps/tasks)\n- Navbar: Plataforma menu item, CalendarDialog button (apps/shell)\n- Home: 5 feature cards with Plataforma, conditional Neurodivergências (apps/shell)\n- Perfil: add Sobrecarga Sensorial option (apps/profile)\n- Shell routes: /plataforma replaces /explore\n- Dashboard vite.config: expose Plataforma instead of Explore\n- New SVG assets for Plataforma page","tree":{"sha":"43fb71d590e24faf37aa66b7754d86ade9f97bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivianur/hackathon-web/git/trees/43fb71d590e24faf37aa66b7754d86ade9f97bee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivianur/hackathon-web/git/commits/779809782d69bcae9237d18b7fa2356078468ead","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51250060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murilao1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murilao1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/murilao1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu