eceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/page-insights/commits/c1001b504ad8a8630f596868c0334c5fe7b106a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:00:29Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:00:29Z","email":"smonier@jahia.com","name":"Stephane Monier"},"message":"docs: add CHANGELOG, starting at 1.2.0\n\nKeep a Changelog format. The 1.0.1 tag sits exactly at the tip before this\nrelease, so the entry covers the range cleanly; earlier releases predate the\nfile and point at the releases page instead.\n\nGrouped by what it means for someone running the module rather than by commit:\nthe two behaviour changes that will visibly move numbers (''All visits'' dropping\nnow that it counts views only, distinct counts reporting 5000+ when capped) are\ncalled out in Fixed, and the mixin removal carries its own upgrade note with the\nquery to run first.\n\nYarn includes CHANGELOG.md in the package automatically, so it ships with the\nmodule.","tree":{"sha":"658d3efc988fc4e7802dba7c09dc57a5e2747277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/page-insights/git/trees/658d3efc988fc4e7802dba7c09dc57a5e2747277"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smonier/page-insights/git/commits/c1001b504ad8a8630f596868c0334c5fe7b106a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/722535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smonier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.c