vin@example.com","name":"Kevin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T16:39:52Z","email":"kevin@example.com","name":"Kevin"},"message":"feat: Add Node.js ES Modules demo and React components showcase\n\n- Created a Node.js ES Modules demo (`hello-world-nodejs.mjs`) showcasing modern features like async/await, file operations, and an HTTP server.\n- Added a React demo (`hello-world-react.jsx`) demonstrating functional components, hooks, and interactive elements.\n- Introduced a shell script (`run-demos.sh`) for executing demos and providing information on running the React demo in a browser.\n- Created Jupyter notebook files (`nodejs.ipynb`, `nodejs_fundamentals_esm.ipynb`) to illustrate Node.js fundamentals and ES Modules.\n- Configured TypeScript settings for Jupyter (`tsconfig.jupyter.json`) to support ESNext modules and strict type checking.\n- Added a kernel configuration for TypeScript in Jupyter (`kernel.json`).\n- Included demo output JSON file (`demo-output.json`) for structured data representation.","tree":{"sha":"5fbb9f6ac148a0d68bb8f5ab932b9550d3017fdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkevin01/nodejs-traditional-autocomplete/git/trees/5fbb9f6ac148a0d68bb8f5ab932b9550d3017fdd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hkevin01/nodejs-traditional-autocomplete/git/commits/d912643806a1a30920274c62f7995b2096614f11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36148089?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinMour/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinMour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinMour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinMour/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VinMour","id":36148089,"login":"VinMour","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MTQ4MDg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinMour