ons","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/cee187ff12e91e9eb9321e0cad6fe3a3d662e2eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:49:45Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:53:05Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"feat: pnpm orbit:init - bootstrap a new project from the template\n\nscripts/orbit-init.mjs (--name, --title, --keep, --dry-run, --yes,\n--no-install) names the workspace and shell, removes the MFEs you don''t\nkeep from every place they''re wired (apps/, MFE_APPS, mfe.config.mjs,\nCI jobs/filters/secrets, docker-compose, turbo env, nav, env example),\nwrites apps/shell/.env with a random SESSION_SECRET, resets the\nCHANGELOG and refreshes the lockfile.\n\nThe text transforms live in scripts/lib/orbit-transforms.mjs and are\ntested against the real repo files for every registered app (CI YAML\nparses, no dangling needs/conditions, compose/turbo/registry/nav clean).\n\nVerified end to end: initialising with --keep react,vue and with\n--keep vue both pass type-check, lint, build, unit and e2e.\n\nDocs: docs/starting-a-new-project.md (template, init, make-it-yours,\nsyncing with Orbit, handover checklist), linked from README/index.","tree":{"sha":"75657eb406f0898f9a9594c0bd6a74bb825f97db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/75657eb406f0898f9a9594c0bd6a74bb825f97db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/cee187ff12e91e9eb9321e0cad6fe3a3d662e2eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com