,"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/1d3d5f2e1529542cf9fff99091c101b94e4b6285/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:46:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:39:02Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"feat(shell): collect telemetry and Core Web Vitals\n\n- POST /api/telemetry accepts beacon batches (size/record limits), logs\n  one JSON line per record for log drains, and optionally forwards to\n  TELEMETRY_FORWARD_URL.\n- startTelemetry() installs the beacon reporter (+ Sentry when the SDK is\n  on the page), global error capture, and reports CLS/INP/LCP/FCP/TTFB\n  tagged with rating and page. Replaces the console.log web-vitals hook,\n  which also still used the deprecated FID.","tree":{"sha":"66b2e8ac7ff291b20a7e6585f417a5655f5e259b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/66b2e8ac7ff291b20a7e6585f417a5655f5e259b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/1d3d5f2e1529542cf9fff99091c101b94e4b6285","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/1d3d5f2e1529542cf9fff99091c101b94e4b6285","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4wI0doAKDFkM2Q1ZjJlMTUyOTU0MmNmOWZmZjk5MDkxYzEwMWI5NGU0YjYyODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/f066ec74c2b84d85d0a70ac899bf14d191ea9935","sha":"f066ec74c2b84d85d0a70ac899bf14d191ea9935","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/f066ec74c2b84d85d0a70ac899bf14d191ea9935"}],"sha":"1d3d5f2e1529542cf9fff99091c101b94e4b6285","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/1d3d5f2e1529542cf9fff99091c101b94e4b6285"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/f066ec74c2b84d85d0a70ac899bf14d191ea9935/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:46:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:39:02Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"feat(core): pluggable telemetry for errors, metrics and events\n\n- telemetry.captureError/captureMetric/captureEvent dispatch to the\n  reporters installed on window, so every MFE bundle reports to the same\n  place the shell configured. A failing reporter never breaks the app.\n- createBeaconReporter: batched sendBeacon (fetch keepalive fallback),\n  flushed on size, interval and page hide.\n- createSentryReporter: adapter for any Sentry-compatible client.\n- captureGlobalErrors: window error + unhandledrejection.\n- MfeHost reports invalid hosts, load and mount failures, and an\n  mfe.load_to_mount metric; both error boundaries report through\n  telemetry. MfeErrorBoundary used to POST to /api/errors, which never\n  existed.","tree":{"sha":"e3f08f966c1d6980ea9a587678beadca49374772","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/e3f08f966c1d6980ea9a587678beadca49374772"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/f066ec74c2b84d85d0a70ac899bf14d191ea9935","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/f066ec74c2b84d85d0a70ac899bf14d191ea9935","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4wI0doAKGYwNjZlYzc0YzJiODRkODVkMGE3MGFjODk5YmYxNGQxOTFlYTk5MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/e6cecbaabd8d232963e9b7bb1f5d56b8bd065a99","sha":"e6cecbaabd8d232963e9b7bb1f5d56b8bd065a99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/e6cecbaabd8d232963e9b7bb1f5d56b8bd065a99"}],"sha":"f066ec74c2b84d85d0a70ac899bf14d191ea9935","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/f066ec74c2b84d85d0a70ac899bf14d191ea9935"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/e6cecbaabd8d232963e9b7bb1f5d56b8bd065a99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:37:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:38:26Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"refactor(shell): use mergeMeta in the generic MFE route\n\nNow that mergeMeta is on main, the /dashboard/:app route uses it instead\nof its own inline parent-meta merge; mergeMeta gains a Loader generic so\nthe route can read its typed loader data.","tree":{"sha":"29cf4060a08adfaf69c257b0f650936ac94df947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/29cf4060a08adfaf69c257b0f650936ac94df947"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/e6cecbaabd8d232963e9b7bb1f5d56b8bd065a99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/e6cecbaabd8d232963e9b7bb1f5d56b8bd065a99","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4wI0doAKGU2Y2VjYmFhYmQ4ZDIzMjk2M2U5YjdiYjFmNWQ1NmI4YmQwNjVhOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/b38316fbd7b3469a33213f63b1eac68100e3bcfa","sha":"b38316fbd7b3469a33213f63b1eac68100e3bcfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/b38316fbd7b3469a33213f63b1eac68100e3bcfa"}],"sha":"e6cecbaabd8d232963e9b7bb1f5d56b8bd065a99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/e6cecbaabd8d232963e9b7bb1f5d56b8bd065a99"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/b38316fbd7b3469a33213f63b1eac68100e3bcfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:18:35Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:38:26Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"fix(core): health-check and version handling for federation-loaded MFEs\n\n- The remoteLoader (Module Federation) path skipped health.json, so an\n  MFE in maintenance was mounted anyway and an unreachable host only\n  showed a generic load error. Check health first, like manifest mode,\n  and don''t download code if the host unmounted meanwhile.\n- On a version change, MfeHost dropped window.MFE[name] and reloaded,\n  but federation can''t re-execute an evaluated module, so it waited 5s\n  for a registration that never came and errored. Keep the running\n  version; the new one loads on the next page load.\n- Tests for maintenance, unreachable host, unmount during health check\n  and version change.","tree":{"sha":"fd31744ed31ca3520b47eaaf4b8070467913dca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/fd31744ed31ca3520b47eaaf4b8070467913dca2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/b38316fbd7b3469a33213f63b1eac68100e3bcfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/b38316fbd7b3469a33213f63b1eac68100e3bcfa","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4wI0doAKGIzODMxNmZiZDdiMzQ2OWEzMzIxM2Y2M2IxZWFjNjgxMDBlM2JjZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/6560e677d1a5691a65ca9d549f64df10b32f11ad","sha":"6560e677d1a5691a65ca9d549f64df10b32f11ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/6560e677d1a5691a65ca9d549f64df10b32f11ad"}],"sha":"b38316fbd7b3469a33213f63b1eac68100e3bcfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/b38316fbd7b3469a33213f63b1eac68100e3bcfa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/6560e677d1a5691a65ca9d549f64df10b32f11ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:14:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:38:26Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"feat: migrate to Module Federation 2.0\n\n@originjs/vite-plugin-federation is effectively unmaintained, and the shell\nhad two loading paths: manifest + <script> injection in dev (federation\nwas disabled there) and originjs'' remoteEntry protocol in production.\n\n- Remotes build with @module-federation/vite (via createMfeConfig):\n  remoteEntry.js + mf-manifest.json, dev and build alike. Only framework\n  runtimes are shared (react/react-dom, vue, svelte, solid-js); platform\n  singletons already live on window via @repo/core.\n- The shell loads remotes with @module-federation/runtime\n  (app/lib/federation.ts) - one path for dev and production, no build\n  plugin in the Remix app (keeps SSR untouched). It provides React as a\n  shared singleton, so React MFEs reuse the shell''s React (verified: no\n  React chunks are fetched from the remote) and injects the expose''s CSS\n  listed in mf-manifest.json.\n- cssCodeSplit is on so the expose''s stylesheet is tracked; previously the\n  MFEs'' own CSS was never loaded inside the shell at all.\n- Builds use a relative base (publicPath auto), so one build works from its\n  own domain, a CDN path or behind /api/proxy/<slug>/.\n- Remove originjs everywhere; drop the dead mfeLoaders virtual module,\n  remotes.d.ts and leftover commented-out config.\n- add-mfe: fix require() in an ES module (the script crashed) and write\n  complete registry entries to both apps.ts and mfe.config.mjs.","tree":{"sha":"6f2e67944b226b5f72f6502d37177f8dbe2c19f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/6f2e67944b226b5f72f6502d37177f8dbe2c19f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/6560e677d1a5691a65ca9d549f64df10b32f11ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravat