 runs each, desktop preset.\n- Budgets: accessibility, best-practices >= 0.9 fail the job on every\n  page, SEO >= 0.9 on public pages; performance >= 0.8 and LCP/CLS/TBT\n  are warnings (shared runners are noisy).\n- New ''Lighthouse CI'' job in the lint workflow; reports go to temporary\n  public storage and are kept as an artifact.\n- pnpm lhci runs the same thing locally.","tree":{"sha":"fb8aefcebd07c64d1aafff13b1293b472a1fa589","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/fb8aefcebd07c64d1aafff13b1293b472a1fa589"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/5340d0fc84be3576b172663b40348e4000d37294","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/5340d0fc84be3576b172663b40348e4000d37294","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4wI0doAKDUzNDBkMGZjODRiZTM1NzZiMTcyNjYzYjQwMzQ4ZTQwMDBkMzcyOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/aa3bad084ed3e7