/api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/33bca74c75491c311420b6abb825aef07d015568/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:25:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:33:32Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"feat(shell): replace mock cookie check with signed session auth\n\nThe dashboard only checked that the Cookie header contained the string\n\"auth_token=\", so any value granted access, logout didn''t clear it, and\n?redirectTo= allowed redirecting to other origins after login.\n\n- Signed cookie session (createCookieSessionStorage); SESSION_SECRET is\n  required in production and supports rotation.\n- requireUser()/getUser() helpers; protected routes redirect to /login\n  and keep the original path in redirectTo.\n- verifyCredentials() is the single plug-in point for a real identity\n  provider; ships with a demo account configurable via env.\n- safeRedirect() only allows same-site relative paths.\n- Login shows credential errors; logout destroys the session (POST only)\n  and clears the shared user store.\n- Dashboard publishes the server-verified user to the shared store\n  instead of a hard-coded dummy user.","tree":{"sha":"6ea28f1a469b26cd796735eb6b92cf468e8964f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/6ea28f1a469b26cd796735eb6b92cf468e8964f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/33bca74c75491c311420b6abb825aef07d015568","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/33bca74c75491c311420b6abb825aef07d015568","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4wI0doAKDMzYmNhNzRjNzU0OTFjMzExNDIwYjZhYmI4MjVhZWYwN2QwMTU1Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/c9d1016e82b82f5ee85afaa2e6b2bd2fe926005b","sha":"c9d1016e82b82f5ee85afaa2e6b2bd2fe926005b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/c9d1016e82b82f5ee85afaa2e6b2bd2fe926005b"}],"sha":"33bca74c75491c311420b6abb825aef07d015568","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/33bca74c75491c311420b6abb825aef07d015568"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/c9d1016e82b82f5ee85afaa2e6b2bd2fe926005b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:29:53Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:33:18Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"refactor(core): remove any and raw console calls, enforce with lint\n\n@repo/core is loaded by every MFE, so loose types leak into all of them.\n\n- Framework factories take typed inputs (MfeRegistry, ReactRootLike,\n  VueAppLike, SvelteComponentConstructor) and keep per-container\n  instances in WeakMaps instead of ad-hoc properties on DOM nodes.\n- Global debug hooks (__MFE_DEBUG__, __MFE_PERF__, Sentry) are declared\n  on Window instead of cast through any.\n- any -> unknown in context/store/logger types; typed manifest entries.\n- All logging goes through the prefixed logger; debug-level messages\n  (registration, i18n, fast-mount) only print in development.\n- packages/core/.eslintrc.cjs: no-explicit-any and no-console are errors\n  (logger/ is exempt).\n- Tests for the Vue/Svelte/Solid factories.","tree":{"sha":"bcce0a9b4f0aac6fd85840048a2f5e1e22ac6b05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/bcce0a9b4f0aac6fd85840048a2f5e1e22ac6b05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/c9d1016e82b82f5