der failed to parse - breaking\n''pnpm --filter app-nextjs build'' entirely on main.\n\nThe ternary itself was also dead logic (both branches returned the same\nliteral ''/''), so there was nothing worth preserving - just removed the\norphaned lines. Verified ''pnpm --filter app-nextjs build'' now succeeds.","tree":{"sha":"8108b59e5b4c9aa023905ac09cb403750dbd5390","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/8108b59e5b4c9aa023905ac09cb403750dbd5390"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/c7b5789d4940b2f0ff46b7f5d03a2d0a199c470c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/c7b5789d4940b2f0ff46b7f5d03a2d0a199c470c","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4wI0doAKGM3YjU3ODlkNDk0MGIyZjBmZjQ2YjdmNWQwM2EyZDBhMTk5YzQ3MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/ce0e062fcaca08f9d394f9d7a08843577f2404cb","sha":"ce0e062fcaca08f9d394f9d7a08843577f2404cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/ce0e062fcaca08f9d394f9d7a08843577f2404cb"}],"sha":"c7b5789d4940b2f0ff46b7f5d03a2d0a199c470c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/c7b5789d4940b2f0ff46b7f5d03a2d0a199c470c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/ce0e062fcaca08f9d394f9d7a08843577f2404cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T08:15:46Z","email":"phamtuandev0907@gmail.com","name":"tian972k"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T08:28:25Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"refactor(core): dedupe common stores + fix locale-store debug logs\n\n- New create-singleton-store.ts: factors out the window-singleton\n  boilerplate (interface GlobalWindow, if/else create-or-reuse) that was\n  repeated identically across counter/locale/theme/user-store.\n- counter-store.ts and locale-store.ts now use the existing (previously\n  unused) syncStore utility instead of hand-rolled globalEventBus.on/emit\n  calls, removing duplicated sync logic and picking up syncStore''s\n  circular-update guard for free.\n- Removed leftover console.log debug statements from locale-store.ts\n  (setLocale/EventBus listener were logging on every call).\n- No behavior changes intended: same singleton-per-page semantics, same\n  cross-MFE sync via EventBus for counter/locale, same\n  persist-to-localStorage for locale/theme. Verified with\n  ''pnpm turbo run lint type-check build'' across the whole monorepo.","tree":{"sha":"6d0ddf4cb97784542b999af070d0b5624c87dfc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/6d0ddf4cb97784542b999af070d0b5624c87dfc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/ce0e062fcaca08f9d394f9d7a08843577f2404cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/ce0e062fcaca08f9d394f9d7a08843577f2404cb","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4wI0doAKGNlMGUwNjJmY2FjYTA4ZjlkMzk0ZjlkN2EwODg0MzU3N2YyNDA0Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/3246333a67b5a283665bd925f5992d141a68d829","sha":"3246333a67b5a283665bd925f5992d141a68d829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/3246333a67b5a283665bd925f5992d141a68d829"}],"sha":"ce0e062fcaca08f9d394f9d7a08843577f2404cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/ce0e062fcaca08f9d394f9d7a08843577f2404cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/3246333a67b5a283665bd925f5992d141a68d829/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T04:02:52Z","email":"phamtuandev0907@gmail.com","name":"tian972k"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:15:50Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"fix(ci): stop uploading empty Vercel build artifacts, remove redundant rebuild\n\napps/<app>/.vercel/output is a dot-directory. Since actions/upload-artifact\nv4.4, hidden files/folders are excluded from uploads by default, so this\nartifact was silently empty. The deploy job compensated by running a full\n''vercel build'' locally on every deploy, defeating the point of splitting\nbuild and deploy into separate jobs and wasting CI minutes on every\nstatic-app deploy (react/vue/svelte/solidjs).\n\n- reusable-build.yml: add include-hidden-files: true to the upload step.\n- reusable-deploy-vercel.yml: fix the download path so the artifact''s\n  (LCA-flattened) contents land back at apps/<app>/.vercel/output, and\n  remove the now-redundant ''Build with Vercel'' step along with the\n  pnpm/Node setup, ''pnpm install'', and packages-build download it only\n  existed to support - none of that is needed once the job just deploys\n  an already-built artifact.\n\nNote: I wasn''t able to test this end-to-end against a real Vercel project\nsince this repo doesn''t have Vercel secrets configured (build-app-*/\ndeploy-app-* jobs are skipped entirely in CI as-is). The fix is based on\nGitHub''s documented upload-artifact v4.4 behavior and standard artifact\npath semantics - worth watching closely on the first real deploy after\nVercel secrets are added.","tree":{"sha":"2f678427dbfdd230cfe94d9d352857b7b538a389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/2f678427dbfdd230cfe94d9d352857b7b538a389"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/3246333a67b5a283665bd925f5992d141a68d829","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/3246333a67b5a283665bd925f5992d141a68d829","node_id":"C_kwDOQ4wI0doAKDMyNDYzMzNhNjdiNWEyODM2NjViZDkyNWY1OTkyZDE0MWE2OGQ4Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commit/efa9acdcd4256e9a79b7e00975c9e820a278fd89","sha":"efa9acdcd4256e9a79b7e00975c9e820a278fd89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/efa9acdcd4256e9a79b7e00975c9e820a278fd89"}],"sha":"3246333a67b5a283665bd925f5992d141a68d829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/3246333a67b5a283665bd925f5992d141a68d829"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/commits/efa9acdcd4256e9a79b7e00975c9e820a278fd89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T03:59:18Z","email":"phamtuandev0907@gmail.com","name":"tian972k"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T06:15:50Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"fix(ci): stop swallowing type-check failures in lint workflow\n\nThe type-check step in reusable-lint.yml had a ''|| echo \"Type check\ncompleted\"'' fallback, which meant the step always exited 0 regardless\nof actual TypeScript errors. This made the ''lint / Lint & Type Check''\nCI check meaningless for type errors - it could never fail on them.\n\nVerified locally with ''pnpm turbo run type-check'' (all packages pass)\nand ''pnpm turbo run lint'' before removing the fallback, so this won''t\nbreak CI on hidden pre-existing errors.\n\nAlso fixed a pre-existing eslint no-unused-vars warning in mfe-host.tsx\n(unused ''error'' binding in a catch block) while in the area.","tree":{"sha":"297ba7e955b17c4ba5667604bbdbc0fc52bd0599","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/297ba7e955b17c4ba5667604bbdbc0fc52bd0599"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/efa9acdcd4256e9a79b7e00975c9e820a278fd89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,