-17T06:15:50Z","email":"149671057+tian972k@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tuan Pham"},"message":"docs: document MFE host trust boundary, registration lifecycle, and add CHANGELOG\n\n- ARCHITECTURE.md: new Security Considerations section covering the\n  MfeHost host validation, and a new MFE Registration & Mount Lifecycle\n  section covering the event-driven registration flow and the mount\n  timeout behavior.\n- TROUBLESHOOTING.md: entries for the new/changed error messages\n  (invalid host, registration timeout, mount timeout).\n- CHANGELOG.md: new file, records the fixes in this change.","tree":{"sha":"a5fb861be8e142c8e96377cc4b2cb15b12f0ce11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/trees/a5fb861be8e142c8e96377cc4b2cb15b12f0ce11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/git/commits/986186995d33f54561562427a6935aa23e1c2e7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149671057?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k","id":149671057,"login":"tian972k","node_id":"U_kgDOCOvMkQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tian972k","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tian972k/micro-fontend-base/com