utils: Utility functions (formatMessage, capitalize, debounce, etc.)\n- @proj/grid: Pre-configured AG-Grid wrapper with theming support\n\nConfiguration:\n- Nx package-based monorepo with npm workspaces\n- Import maps for shared dependencies (react, react-dom, @mantine/*, @proj/grid)\n- CSS Modules across all projects\n- TypeScript with strict mode","tree":{"sha":"3bbfeee1743f0b3b4b54edc188c131597a7321d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monobyte/nx-piral-vite7/git/trees/3bbfeee1743f0b3b4b54edc188c131597a7321d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monobyte/nx-piral-vite7/git/commits/016af11041b70cd94fdf307a2cba9032467d8504","verification":{"payload":"tree 3bbfeee1743f0b3b4b54edc188c131597a7321d1\nparent 997e1f78ba87bff255c7a42a6068bd9c8df643df\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1768299743 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1768299743 +0000\n\nfeat: Add Nx Package-Based Monorepo with Piral, Vite 7, and Mantine UI\n\nSet up a production-ready micro-frontend architecture with:\n\nShell (apps/shell):\n- Piral instance with React 18 and piral-cli-vite7 bundler\n- Mantine UI v7 with AppShell layout\n- Dashboard page and error handling\n- Local pilet feed for development\n\nMFE1 (apps/mfe1):\n- Pilet with Mantine form controls demo\n- TextInput, Select, Switch, Slider, Checkbox, Button\n- CSS Modules styling\n\nMFE2 (apps/mfe2):\n- Pilet with AG-Grid data table\n- Sorting, filtering, pagination, row selection\n- CSV export functionality\n- Custom cell renderers\n\nShared packages:\n- @proj/utils: Utility functions (formatMessage, capitalize, debounce, etc.)\n- @proj/grid: Pre-configured AG-Grid wrapper with theming support\n\nConfiguration:\n- Nx package-based monorepo with npm workspaces\n- Import maps for shared dependencies (react, react-dom, @mantine/*, @proj/grid)\n- CSS Modules across all projects\n- TypeScript with strict mode\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by