4+jhorman9@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jhorman9"},"message":"feat: implementar arquitectura micro-frontend con Module Federation\n\n- Agregar aplicación host shell (puerto 4200)\n- Agregar aplicación remote characters (puerto 4201)\n- Crear librería compartida con CharactersContext y hook useFetch\n- Configurar Module Federation con Nx y Rspack\n- Implementar carga dinámica de remotes con React.lazy\n- Integrar API de Rick & Morty\n- Configurar referencias de proyecto TypeScript para monorepo\n- Agregar alias de resolución para @micro-frontend/shared\n- Corregir problemas de compatibilidad con Vite 7 (downgrade a v6)\n- Crear README detallado con explicación de arquitectura y ejemplos\n\nArquitectura:\n- Shell: Aplicación host con router y providers globales\n- Characters: Aplicación remote con componente de lista de personajes\n- Shared: Librería común con hooks, contextos y modelos\n\nStack tecnológico: React 19, TypeScript, Module Federation, Nx, Rspack, pnpm","tree":{"sha":"07624ef7e7edd6e28fc6b90cd2bdcaed371d9384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jhorman9/microfrontend-module-federation/git/trees/07624ef7e7edd6e28fc6b90cd2bdcaed371d9384"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jhorman9/microfrontend-module-federation/git/commits/390d063f9c873bf6faee2496cf7fbcd82ee65713","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79775604?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhorman9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhorman9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhorman9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhorman9/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jhorman9","id":79775604,"login":"jhorman9","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5Nzc1NjA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhorman9/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.gith