ents shared per provider and model\n- A fallback only when LLM_<ROLE>_FALLBACK is set, counted in /metrics and named in the disclosure\n- Unknown provider, missing key or missing package fail /ready, naming the role and the variable\n- Metrics per role and model; render audit carries the model that answered\n- OpenAI''s own endpoint on the Responses API with store=false; OPENAI_BASE_URL endpoints keep chat completions\n- Schema fallback to json_object only on a 400\n- One default model; openai>=1.66.0\n- posture.sh lists generation destinations per role","tree":{"sha":"3903b57ce5f08a590bc5c2cecd7ff07b9de71955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/git/trees/3903b57ce5f08a590bc5c2cecd7ff07b9de71955"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/git/commits/32d40ad9afff6b89c6562143150618c127416097","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56829605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo","id":56829605,"login":"thevladdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODI5NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo/genui-framework/commit/32d40ad9afff6b89c6562143150618c127416097","node_id":"C_kwDOQ5RVXNoAKDMyZDQwYWQ5YWZmZjZiODljNjU2MjE0MzE1MDYxOGMxMjc0MTYwOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo/genui-framework/commit/714d4782f65b05924c290824413f5edcbee41b7b","sha":"714d4782f65b05924c290824413f5edcbee41b7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/714d4782f65b05924c290824413f5edcbee41b7b"}],"sha":"32d40ad9afff6b89c6562143150618c127416097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/32d40ad9afff6b89c6562143150618c127416097"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56829605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo","id":56829605,"login":"thevladdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODI5NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/714d4782f65b05924c290824413f5edcbee41b7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:23:32Z","email":"vlad.dogariu@studenti.unicam.it","name":"Vlad Dogariu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:23:32Z","email":"vlad.dogariu@studenti.unicam.it","name":"Vlad Dogariu"},"message":"Chat sessions on the server\n\n- /query takes and returns session_id; the server keeps the recent messages and a summary of older ones\n- The summary is charged to the LLM budget before it runs; without budget the window slides\n- Session store down: the chat answers without memory and says so in meta\n- Sessions with a user follow profile retention and are exported and erased with the profile\n- DELETE /api/v1/query/sessions/{session_id}\n- useGenUI sends session_id and the new message; the id goes to sessionStorage only with consent\n- clearHistory deletes the session on the server first","tree":{"sha":"20e60f9de7925b7a12525142349c28126a41dd1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/git/trees/20e60f9de7925b7a12525142349c28126a41dd1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/git/commits/714d4782f65b05924c290824413f5edcbee41b7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56829605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo","id":56829605,"login":"thevladdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODI5NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo/genui-framework/commit/714d4782f65b05924c290824413f5edcbee41b7b","node_id":"C_kwDOQ5RVXNoAKDcxNGQ0NzgyZjY1YjA1OTI0YzI5MDgyNDQxM