tps://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo","id":56829605,"login":"thevladdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODI5NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/ecd9d797e1f28cd38422ae4b7db473a029d7fa13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T22:21:30Z","email":"vlad.dogariu@studenti.unicam.it","name":"Vlad Dogariu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T22:21:30Z","email":"vlad.dogariu@studenti.unicam.it","name":"Vlad Dogariu"},"message":"Harden backend, frontend and studio for enterprise use\n\nBackend\n- Signed user identity (HMAC X-User-Token) and fail-closed auth: with no keys configured the privileged routes now refuse instead of opening, unless GENUI_DEV_OPEN is set.\n- Cached zone renders use the segment archetype instead of the raw client profile, so a single request cannot poison a whole segment.\n- Chat pipeline isolated per request and moved off datapizza onto the internal llm/ abstraction; the RAG tool no longer crashes when the model calls it.\n- Redis is a declared dependency with reconnect and a size-bounded memory fallback, so several workers stay consistent.\n- Pluggable embeddings (EMBEDDING_PROVIDER / EMBEDDING_BASE_URL), independent of the chat provider.\n- Per-tenant LLM budget, admin-only live renders, single-flight on the cold miss, request timeouts.\n- Honest health (checks Redis and the LLM), plus /metrics, readiness and liveness.\n- Numeric grounding and per-tenant content policy added to the guarantee chain, on the sync, SSE and chat paths.\n\nFrontend\n- Dual ESM/CJS packaging with an exports map: require() no longer throws.\n- Chart code split into a lazy chunk and framer-motion removed: base ESM bundle from 460KB to about 134KB gzipped.\n- Server render emits the skeleton, zone props refetch on change with abort, keyboard navigation and reduced-motion support, contract_version on responses.\n- Privacy filter for the behavior tracker (data-genui-private, redaction, Do Not Track, strict/balanced/off).\n- meta.behavior, meta.sanitization and BentoCard.action now reach the UI; opaque card metadata kept verbatim.\n\nStudio\n- Measure page: CTR, uplift and the two-proportion z-test with honest empty states, plus warmup and cache stats.\n\nDocs and tests\n- README refreshed (project structure, data flow, per-feature sections), first CHANGELOG, deploy guides and the output-guarantees document.\n- Golden zone harness with fixtures; tests from 168 to 363.","tree":{"sha":"e2706b037595167e52c047d6037841de383e9ecc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/git/trees/e2706b037595167e52c047d6037841de383e9ecc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/git/commits/ecd9d797e1f28cd38422ae4b7db473a029d7fa13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56829605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo","id":56829605,"login":"thevladdo",