ns_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/b63ae48cb90a72cf3350c099b597c1b78f489c5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:03:42Z","email":"vlad.dogariu@studenti.unicam.it","name":"Vlad Dogariu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:03:42Z","email":"vlad.dogariu@studenti.unicam.it","name":"Vlad Dogariu"},"message":"GenUI Studio and expand the enterprise component library\n\nStudio (studio/): a Vite + React companion app, hash-routed.\n- Theme Playground: live token editing (color, radius, blur, font) with a\n  shareable URL, previewing every GenUI component.\n- Content Studio: RAG document upload and query testing, gated to local\n  dev.\n- About (#/about): business-facing \"what is GenUI\" page.\n\nLibrary (frontend/): semantic design tokens (surfaces, text-on-accent,\nradius scale, mode) with legacy-name dual emission, image-optional\ncomponents, and 7 new enterprise components (HeroBanner, PricingCards,\nStatsBanner, StepsSection, TabsFeature, TestimonialCarousel, ContentGrid)\nwith matching Pydantic schemas and registry entries.","tree":{"sha":"31d27065d9d03428faa091a668997eb8876ab7e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/git/trees/31d27065d9d03428faa091a668997eb8876ab7e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/git/commits/b63ae48cb90a72cf3350c099b597c1b78f489c5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56829605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo","id":56829605,"login":"thevladdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODI5NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo/genui-framework/commit/b63ae48cb90a72cf3350c099b597c1b78f489c5c","node_id":"C_kwDOQ5RVXNoAKGI2M2FlNDhjYjkwYTcyY2YzMzUwYzA5OWI1OTdjMWI3OGY0ODljNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo/genui-framework/commit/049763d305f8a821c7bd7f85c700792769a1cfcb","sha":"049763d305f8a821c7bd7f85c700792769a1cfcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/049763d305f8a821c7bd7f85c700792769a1cfcb"}],"sha":"b63ae48cb90a72cf3350c099b597c1b78f489c5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/b63ae48cb90a72cf3350c099b597c1b78f489c5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56829605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo","id":56829605,"login":"thevladdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODI5NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/049763d305f8a821c7bd7f85c700792769a1cfcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T21:17:01Z","email":"vlad.dogariu@studenti.unicam.it","name":"Vlad Dogariu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T21:17:01Z","email":"vlad.dogariu@studenti.unicam.it","name":"Vlad Dogariu"},"message":"Production hardening: segment cache, output guarantees, auth, measurement, extensibility\n\nMajor overhaul to make the framework production/enterprise ready.\n\nExecution model\n- Segment-based render cache (Redis + in-memory, stale-while-revalidate,\n  single-flight): the LLM runs once per user segment, not per request\n- Deterministic profile segmenter; /zone/warmup for offline pre-rendering\n- SSE streaming endpoint (/zone/render/stream) with incremental JSON\n  parsing for progressive render; streaming prop on GenUIZone\n\nOutput guarantees\n- Provider-native structured output (json_schema with json_object fallback)\n- Per-component Pydantic validation; invalid components dropped, not fatal\n- Hard URL whitelist: only URLs present in the input survive; dangerous\n  schemes always stripped; pinned content enforced post-generation\n- Frontend sanitizeUrl defense-in-depth on rendered hrefs\n\nSecurity & profiles\n- API-key auth (client/admin) with multi-tenancy, rate limiting\n- Server-side profile store (source of truth; IndexedDB demoted to cache),\n  GDPR erasure endpoint; tenant-scoped zone cache and RAG collection\n- Append-only audit log: what was shown to whom, per render/query/event\n\nMeasurement\n- Sticky holdout experiment (control arm gets non-personalized render)\n- Impression/click ingestion per generated variant (render_id)\n- Uplift stats with two-proportion z-test significance\n\nExtensibility & providers\n- Custom component registry: host apps register name + JSON Schema +\n  React component; schemas join the LLM vocabulary and the validation\n- LLM provider abstraction: OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini (and any\n  OpenAI-compatible endpoint) selected by configuration\n- Pluggable document extraction: local (pypdf/docx/bs4), docling, glmocr;\n  file upload endpoint (PDF/DOCX/HTML/TXT/MD), document listing and\n  search-preview endpoints\n\nFixes & hygiene\n- Removed broken process_async/_executor in orchestrator\n- RAG search cache invalidation on document changes\n- SSR-safety guards (IndexedDB/BehaviorTracker); OpenTelemetry tracing\n- 159 unit tests (backend)","tree":{"sha":"131549170e7455cc4e698cdeddf344c75fa34fe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/git/trees/131549170e7455cc4e698cdeddf344c75fa34fe1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/git/commits/049763d305f8a821c7bd7f85c700792769a1cfcb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56829605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo","id":56829605,"login":"thevladdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODI5NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo/genui-framework/commit/049763d305f8a821c7bd7f85c700792769a1cfcb","node_id":"C_kwDOQ5RVXNoAKDA0OTc2M2QzMDVmOGE4MjFjN2JkN2Y4NWM3MDA3OTI3NjlhMWNmY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo/genui-framework/commit/36d1792b7a505e8cf9d408a743ab4603eedeef41","sha":"36d1792b7a505e8cf9d408a743ab4603eedeef41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/36d1792b7a505e8cf9d408a743ab4603eedeef41"}],"sha":"049763d305f8a821c7bd7f85c700792769a1cfcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/049763d305f8a821c7bd7f85c700792769a1cfcb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56829605?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thevladdo","id":56829605,"login":"thevladdo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2ODI5NjA1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thevladdo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thevladdo/genui-framework/commits/36d1792b7a505e8cf9d408a743ab4603eedeef41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T22:41:06Z","email":"vlad.dogariu@studenti.unicam.it","name":"Vlad Dogariu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-13T22:41:06Z","email":"vlad.dogariu@studenti.unicam.it","name":"Vlad D